        "func": "msg.topic = \"Line BC\";\n\n// Gabungkan dua 16-bit register jadi 32-bit float\nlet buf = Buffer.alloc(4);\nbuf.writeUInt16BE(msg.payload[2], 0);  // High word\nbuf.writeUInt16BE(msg.payload[3], 2);  // Low word\n\nlet value = buf.readFloatBE(0);      // Big Endian format\nmsg.payload = parseFloat(value.toFixed(2));\nreturn msg;",
